      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "部件摆位直接管理资源连接、效果联动和叠加加成",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Positioning is the core of the game. Move parts around to manage resources, connect item effects, and stack bonuses.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3523750/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "战斗自动进行，但会异步匹配其他玩家保存的飞船",
